[0.17,"o","make[1]: Entering directory '/agent/repos/or-signals'\r\n/home/ubuntu/.local/bin/uv run python research/phase0/signal_quality/run.py\r\n# signal_quality results\r\n\r\nSQI rejects flush/damping and reports dropout gaps without interpolation. The 42 mmHg damped plateau is not labeled hypotension on usable samples.\r\n\r\n| case | ABP usable | SpO2 usable | raw hypo | usable hypo |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| artifact | 0.750 | 1.000 | True | False |\r\n| bolus | 1.000 | 1.000 | False | False |\r\n| clean | 1.000 | 1.000 | False | False |\r\n| dropout | 0.667 | 0.667 | False | False |\r\n| no-label | 1.000 | 0.967 | False | False |\r\n\r\n/home/ubuntu/.local/bin/uv run python research/phase0/label_availability/run.py\r\n# label_availability results\r\n\r\nAwareness labels are essentially absent (1/200 index, 0/5 samples). The project pivots to over-sedation / depth-index risk. Awareness remains an unmeasured rare-event target.\r\n\r\n| set | n | awareness labels | usable depth labels |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| sample cases | 5 | 0 | 4 |\r\n| synthetic index | 200 | 1 | 79 |\r\n\r\nIndex depth-label rate = 0.395.\r\n\r\n/home/ubuntu/.local/bin/uv run python research/phase0/pkpd_validation/run.py\r\n# pkpd_validation results\r\n\r\nPK/PD layer is doing useful work: after the bolus, Ce diverges from raw infusion rate and tracks the depth-index proxy more closely. The proxy is not an awareness label.\r\n\r\n| predictor | corr vs (100-BIS proxy) |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| effect-site Ce | 0.990 |\r\n| raw infusion rate | -0.294 |\r\n\r\n/home/ubuntu/.local/bin/uv run python research/phase0/operating_point/run.py\r\n# operating_point results\r\n\r\nPivot to over-sedation is already decided (awareness labels 1/200). On the designed bolus-vs-clean windows, a Ce threshold of 0.5 \u00b5g/ml gives TPR=1.000, FPR=0.000, precision=1.000. This is a research operating point, not a monitor alarm.\r\n\r\nGold is the designed post-bolus window, not an awareness label.\r\n\r\n| Ce threshold | TP | FP | TN | FN | TPR | FPR | precision |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| 0.5 | 35 | 0 | 85 | 0 | 1.000 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 1.0 | 31 | 0 | 85 | 4 | 0.886 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 1.5 | 27 | 0 | 85 | 8 | 0.771 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 2.0 | 23 | 0 | 85 | 12 | 0.657 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 2.5 | 18 | 0 | 85 | 17 | 0.514 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 3.0 | 13 | 0 | 85 | 22 | 0.371 | 0.000 | 1.000 |\r\n| 4.0 | 0 | 0 | 85 | 35 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 |\r\n\r\n/home/ubuntu/.local/bin/uv run python research/phase0/render_docs.py\r\nwrote memo, EVALUATION.md, README results\r\nmake[1]: Leaving directory '/agent/repos/or-signals'\r\n"]
